{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic reality, where madness reigns, you are forced to face it in an enormous bunker. But is escaping to the outside any better?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/cf97d5a036082ea2a37e6deb07867c96.avif?t=1761310906\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules have changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our home has become a desolate wasteland, taken over by <strong>Lost</strong> individuals.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A human suffering from <i><strong>UPT</strong></i> (<i>Umbra Post-Trauma</i>)&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>UPT</strong></i> individuals suffer from <i>extreme\u00a0dissociation</i>. This removes all limits the brain imposes on us (e.g.: Rotating your eyes in impossible ways, running with no feeling of getting tired, and losing social interests).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never try to interact with a <strong>Lost</strong> individual.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/c856f3fccc9f9fcb328b255986ca0c3f.avif?t=1761310906\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied enemies, each with different traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadful, semi-liminal atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple options to face your challenges, either go smart and sneaky, or dumb and loud\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good optimization, allowing players to enjoy smooth gameplay on low-end systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2414850/e78aa00d919876038848241a2159f2ac46553efb.jpg"},{"name":"Wrong Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2414850/debafbc082bca8256082683e38593ae4e0d3a6e6.jpg"},{"name":"Escape!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2414850/e3c6d25171f74b7fe129bb9f52793d1ac2fc2e54.jpg"},{"name":"Stop Chasing Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2414850/c6366cab2e2a306578a269ce95c18226dee6612a.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2414850?t=1761310906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2414850?t=1761310906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/a0db210f3f719865a6d4d2c96b5379c56d7b0a5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761310906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/a0db210f3f719865a6d4d2c96b5379c56d7b0a5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761310906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descript